       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. INSPECT-TALLYING-EX.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-TEXT  PIC X(20) VALUE "MISSISSIPPI".
       01 WS-COUNT PIC 99 VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           INSPECT WS-TEXT TALLYING WS-COUNT FOR ALL "S".
           DISPLAY "S COUNT=" WS-COUNT.
           INSPECT WS-TEXT REPLACING ALL "I" BY "1".
           DISPLAY WS-TEXT.
           STOP RUN.
